em] are shackles and burning fire","t":{"6":[[350,1660],[1670,2800],[2810,6630],[6640,9230]],"12":[[200,1430],[1440,2430],[2440,5880],[5890,8260]],"7":[[30,1250],[1260,2960],[2970,5320],[5330,7520]],"9":[[450,1830],[1840,4130],[4140,5810],[5820,7860]]}},{"k":13,"w":[["وَطَعَامًۭا","wata'aaman"],["ذَا","dhaa"],["غُصَّةٍۢ","ghussatin"],["وَعَذَابًا","wa'adhaaban"],["أَلِيمًۭا","aleeman"]],"en":"And food that chokes and a painful punishment -","t":{"6":[[250,2460],[2470,3280],[3290,5420],[5430,7410],[7420,8910]],"12":[[40,2270],[2280,2990],[3000,4860],[4870,6640],[6650,8150]],"7":[[30,1810],[1820,2200],[2210,3200],[3210,5070],[5080,6240]],"9":[[350,2290],[2300,2660],[2670,4490],[4500,5890],[5900,6950]]}},{"k":14,"w":[["يَوْمَ","yawma"],["تَرْجُفُ","tarjufu"],["ٱلْأَرْضُ","l-ardu"],["وَٱلْجِبَالُ","wal-jibaalu"],["وَكَانَتِ","wakaanati"],["ٱلْجِبَالُ","l-jibaalu"],["كَثِيبًۭا","katheeban"],["مَّهِيلًا","maheelan"]],"en":"On the Day the earth and the mountains will convulse and the mountains will become a heap of sand pouring down.","t":{"6":[[60,850],[860,2240],[2250,3530],[3540,5480],[5490,7320],[7330,8900],[8910,10380],[10390,12610]],"12":[[250,1000],[1010,2260],[2270,3430],[3440,5120],[5130,6650],[6660,8140],[8150,9530],[9540,11670]],"7":[[60,520],[530,1380],[1390,2170],[2180,3300],[3310,4260],[4270,5190],[5200,5880],[5890,7950]],"9":[[300,890],[900,1940],[1950,2840],[2850,4360],[4370,5520],[5530,6670],[6680,7530],[7540,9490]]}},{"k":15,"w":[["إِنَّآ","innaa"],["أَرْسَلْنَآ","arsalnaa"],["إِلَيْكُمْ","ilaykum"],["رَسُولًۭا","rasoolan"],["شَـٰهِدًا","shaahidan"],["عَلَيْكُمْ","'alaykum"],["كَمَآ","kamaa"],["أَرْسَلْنَآ","arsalnaa"],["إِلَىٰ","ilaa"],["فِرْعَوْنَ","fir''awna"],["رَسُولًۭا","rasoolan"]],"en":"Indeed, We have sent to you a Messenger as a witness upon you just as We sent to Pharaoh a messenger.","t":{"6":[[850,2030],[2040,5200],[5210,8040],[8050,10060],[10070,11780],[11790,13530],[13540,14030],[14040,17180],[17190,19600],[19610,21230],[21240,22850]],"